        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Regimen duration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.4465942382812,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "The regimen comprises an intensive phase of 4 months that may be extended to 6 months when no",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.4422607421875,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "bacteriological conversion is seen at the end of the fourth month of treatment, and a continuation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.4453735351562,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "phase of 5 months; hence, if extended, the regimens may last 11 months. In the dataset reviewed,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        470.4466857910156,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "the duration of bedaquiline and linezolid was restricted to 6 and 2 months, respectively.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        160.26649475097656,
        208.76412963867188,
        175.92648315429688
      ],
      "text": "Patient-centred approach",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.13453674316406,
        459.79534912109375,
        197.57752990722656
      ],
      "text": "Efforts are required to provide patient support to enable full adherence to treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.9276885986328,
        516.0933837890625,
        231.8076934814453
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations 2.2 and 2.3 The modified 9-month all-oral",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.9276885986328,
        253.31573486328125,
        250.8076934814453
      ],
      "text": "regimens for MDR/RR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        262.51312255859375,
        236.23428344726562,
        276.86810302734375
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation (NEW)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        284.12774658203125,
        515.3857421875,
        298.6807556152344
      ],
      "text": "2.2 WHO suggests using the 9-month all-oral regimens (BLMZ, BLLfxCZ and BDLLfxZ) over",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        296.23773193359375,
        519.6548461914062,
        310.6807556152344
      ],
      "text": "currently recommended longer (>18 months) regimens in patients with MDR/RR-TB and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        308.23773193359375,
        499.9043884277344,
        322.6807556152344
      ],
      "text": "in whom resistance to fluoroquinolones has been excluded. Among these regimens,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        320.2377014160156,
        506.5561218261719,
        334.68072509765625
      ],
      "text": "using BLMZ is suggested over using BLLfxCZ, and BLLfxCZ is suggested over BDLLfxZ.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        335.2135925292969,
        389.42132568359375,
        350.8775939941406
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        357.9942321777344,
        472.78826904296875,
        372.5472412109375
      ],
      "text": "2.3 WHO suggests against using 9-month DCLLfxZ or DCMZ regimens compared",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        370.1042175292969,
        463.1127014160156,
        384.5472412109375
      ],
      "text": "with currently recommended longer (>18 months) regimens in patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        382.1042175292969,
        301.2685546875,
        396.5472412109375
      ],
      "text": "fluoroquinolone-susceptible MDR/RR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        397.0802001953125,
        389.42132568359375,
        412.74420166015625
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.47662353515625,
        119.47928619384766,
        445.32861328125
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.5364990234375,
        527.5888671875,
        466.9795227050781
      ],
      "text": "1.\t The recommended modified 9-month all-oral regimens comprise bedaquiline, linezolid and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        465.73651123046875,
        527.590087890625,
        480.1795349121094
      ],
      "text": "pyrazinamide in different combinations with levofloxacin/moxifloxacin, clofazimine and delamanid.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970359802246094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        483.1885070800781,
        298.9967041015625,
        497.63153076171875
      ],
      "text": "2.\t This recommendation applies to the following:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        500.6405029296875,
        509.91357421875,
        515.08349609375
      ],
      "text": "a.\t People with MDR/RR-TB and in whom resistance to fluoroquinolones has been excluded.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        518.0924072265625,
        527.4256591796875,
        532.535400390625
      ],
      "text": "b.\t People with diagnosed pulmonary TB, including children, adolescents, PLHIV, and pregnant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        531.2924194335938,
        229.63348388671875,
        545.7354125976562
      ],
      "text": "and breastfeeding women.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        548.744384765625,
        527.4376220703125,
        563.1873779296875
      ],
      "text": "c.\t People with extensive TB disease and all forms of extrapulmonary TB except for TB involving",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        561.9443969726562,
        491.89892578125,
        576.3873901367188
      ],
      "text": "the CNS, osteoarticular TB or disseminated forms of TB with multiorgan involvement.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        579.3964233398438,
        527.5015258789062,
        593.8394165039062
      ],
      "text": "d.\t  People with MDR/RR-TB and less than 1 month of previous exposure to any of the component",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        592.596435546875,
        527.4420166015625,
        607.0394287109375
      ],
      "text": "medicines of the regimen (apart from pyrazinamide and fluoroquinolones). When exposure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        605.79638671875,
        527.441162109375,
        620.2393798828125
      ],
      "text": "is greater than 1 month, these patients may still receive one of the regimens if resistance to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        618.9963989257812,
        389.2699890136719,
        633.4393920898438
      ],
      "text": "the specific medicines with such exposure has been ruled out.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        636.4484252929688,
        527.44091796875,
        650.8914184570312
      ],
      "text": "e.\t Children and adolescents who do not have bacteriological confirmation of TB or resistance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        649.6483154296875,
        527.38818359375,
        664.09130859375
      ],
      "text": "patterns but do have a high likelihood of MDR/RR-TB (based on clinical signs and symptoms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        662.8483276367188,
        514.6876831054688,
        677.2913208007812
      ],
      "text": "of TB, in combination with a history of contact with a patient with confirmed MDR/RR-TB).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        690.6654663085938,
        128.1744842529297,
        706.5175170898438
      ],
      "text": "Rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        713.7255249023438,
        527.0965576171875,
        728.1685180664062
      ],
      "text": "The rationale for these recommendations is based on the evidence and considerations detailed in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.982085227966309,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        726.925537109375,
        527.41357421875,
        741.3685302734375
      ],
      "text": "subsections below. These 9-month regimens (BLMZ, BLLfxCZ and BDLLfxZ) can be used in patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.12548828125,
        527.4059448242188,
        754.5684814453125
      ],
      "text": "with MDR/RR-TB (in whom resistance to FQ has been excluded) who cannot be offered one of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.3255004882812,
        527.1683959960938,
        767.7684936523438
      ],
      "text": "6-month regimens. These regimens are the preferred option over the longer (>18-month) regimens,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995099067687988,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "98 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
